S-LLM

S-LLM is a modified version of Scratch Editor, with natural-language programming
assistance, AI chat, asset selection, and server integration.
Fork changes are recorded in the Git history from 2026-02-24 onward.
License and attribution integration updated: 2026-10-29.

Upstream: https://github.com/scratchfoundation/scratch-editor
Fork source: https://github.com/in044/sllm
Additional Git remote: https://github.com/kyurururn/sllm
The public source offer uses in044/sllm; it does not depend on the other remote.

